<section class="priorities" data-controller="priorities" aria-labelledby="priorities-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="priorities-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">04 / A DIFFERENT DAY. A DIFFERENT FOCUS.</div><h2 id="priorities-title">Keep your eye on<br> <span class="serif">what matters today.</span></h2></div><div class="day-toggle" data-priorities-target="controls" role="group" aria-label="Example trading day" hidden><button type="button" data-action="priorities#change" data-mode="normal" data-priorities-target="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="normal-priorities">Normal days</button><button type="button" data-action="priorities#change" data-mode="sale" data-priorities-target="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="sale-priorities">Sale days <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></div>
    <div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
      <div class="day-panel" id="normal-priorities" data-priorities-target="panel" data-mode="normal">
        <div class="day-copy"><span class="day-label">THE EVERYDAY EDIT / NORMAL DAYS</span><h3>Make the everyday<br> details work harder.</h3><p>A focused list for the work between campaigns.</p><ol class="priority-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Clean up the catalog</strong><p>Review missing size guides and conflicting details.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Understand product discovery</strong><p>Look at exposure and views before judging demand.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Keep availability in view</strong><p>Check which sizes shoppers can actually buy.</p></div></li></ol></div>
        <div class="priority-demo"><div class="demo-top"><span>Today's focus</span><span class="demo-label">ILLUSTRATIVE DEMO</span></div><div class="priority-card-header"><span class="large-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="severity">CATALOG QUALITY</span></div><h3>A great product.<br> A missing piece of information.</h3><p>Everyday linen kurta</p><div class="priority-observation"><span>Available sizes</span><strong>S / M / L</strong></div><div class="priority-observation"><span>Size measurements</span><strong>Missing</strong></div><div class="priority-recommendation"><span class="eyebrow">SUGGESTED NEXT STEP</span><p>Ask the catalog team to verify and add garment measurements.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-panel" id="sale-priorities" data-priorities-target="panel" data-mode="sale">
        <div class="day-copy"><span class="day-label">THE CAMPAIGN EDIT / SALE DAYS</span><h3>Before the traffic arrives,<br> check the details.</h3><p>A focused list for the days with more at stake.</p><ol class="priority-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Check the offer is accurate</strong><p>Compare campaign promises with selling prices.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Review stock coverage</strong><p>Check size availability on promoted products.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Look beyond campaign clicks</strong><p>Review carts, orders and final outcomes together.</p></div></li></ol></div>
        <div class="priority-demo"><div class="demo-top"><span>Today's focus</span><span class="demo-label">ILLUSTRATIVE DEMO</span></div><div class="priority-card-header"><span class="large-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="severity">PROMOTION COVERAGE</span></div><h3>In the spotlight.<br> But only one size is left.</h3><p>Example featured summer set</p><div class="priority-observation"><span>Available sizes</span><strong><s>XS / S / M</s> / L / <s>XL</s></strong></div><div class="priority-observation"><span>Campaign placement</span><strong>Homepage feature</strong></div><div class="priority-recommendation"><span class="eyebrow">SUGGESTED NEXT STEP</span><p>Review size coverage before continuing the promotion. No campaign is changed.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="priority-footnote">Example priorities for a product in development. Recommendations would depend on the evidence available.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="team section shell" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <div class="team-copy"><div class="eyebrow">05 / BUILT AROUND YOUR JUDGMENT</div><h2 id="team-title">An extra set of eyes.<br> <span class="serif">You're still in charge.</span></h2><p>Your team knows the collection, the customer and the context. Sellora is being built to bring the evidence together, so you can decide what happens next.</p></div>
  <div class="control-list"><div><span class="control-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><h3>Review the reasoning</h3><p>See the finding, its source and what needs verification.</p></div></div><div><span class="control-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><h3>Decide as a team</h3><p>Evaluate recommendations before making store changes.</p></div></div><div><span class="control-later">LATER</span><div><h3>Choose your limits</h3><p>Optional autopilot is a future capability, with merchant-defined limits and an off switch.</p></div></div></div>
